1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,850
What if your work got done… while you slept?

2
00:00:02,950 --> 00:00:05,850
That's the promise of AI agents.

3
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:08,900
Emails. Meetings. Reports. Follow-ups.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,700
Every week, the to-do list multiplies.

5
00:00:12,350 --> 00:00:15,400
An AI agent doesn't just answer questions.

6
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:18,750
It plans, acts and follows through — on its own.

7
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:22,000
Before AI, every task landed on one desk.

8
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:24,800
Yours. Hours of copying, filing and chasing.

9
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:28,200
But here's the catch: AI agents make mistakes.

10
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:31,200
Wrong numbers, confident tone. Always check the work.

11
00:00:31,850 --> 00:00:34,600
So… will AI take your job?

12
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:37,750
It will take tasks. That's not the same thing.

13
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:41,400
AI can draft. But judgment, taste and creativity

14
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:44,750
still come from people. From you.

15
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:48,400
The people who thrive will learn the tools,

16
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:51,500
adapt fast, and create more than ever.

17
00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:56,400
Would you trust AI with your job?

18
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:59,800
Yes or no — tell me in the comments.

